A simple Python CLI application that helps users choose a birthday dessert based on their preferences for:
 - Cake or cupcakes
 - Yolk or no yolk
 - Milk or no milk
 
 Once preferences are provided, the system outputs a matched recipe and offers instructions either on-screen or via a URL.
 
 ---
 
 # Installation Instructions
 
 # Prerequisites
 
 Make sure you have the following installed:
 
 - **Python 3.x** — [https://www.python.org/downloads](https://www.python.org/downloads)
 - **Git** — [https://git-scm.com/downloads](https://git-scm.com/downloads)
 - **Terminal or Command Prompt** (macOS, Linux, or Windows)
 
 ---
 
 ### 📥 Setup Steps
 
 1. **Clone this repository:**
 
 git clone https://github.com/DominiqueSolo/Birthday-Cake-Choice-Maker.git
 
 Navigate into the project directory: cd Birthday-Cake-Choice-Maker
 
 Run the application: python src/main.py
 
 EXAMPLE CODE:
 
 Welcome to the Birthday Cake Choice Maker!
 Whole cake or cupcakes? cupcakes
 Yolk or no yolk? yolk
 Milk or no milk? no milk
 View instructions on screen or URL? screen
 (Recipe instructions display...)
